  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **With My Own Bare Hands** (1 review): Listener singles out this track as a memorable highlight of the set [4]\n- **Someday** (1 review): The song and the subsequent encore were noted as particularly good [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **It's Gonna Be A Long Night**: back after 97 archived shows (1359 days) [6]\n- **Laura**: back after 37 archived shows (644 days) [6]\n- **Booze Me And Get Me High**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Buenes Tardes**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2011-04-14.km184** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 167 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n- **ween2011-04-14.ccm41**: source not stated; 33 songs; 167 min; rated 1/5 by 1 [2]. Said about its sound: Microphone placement was too distant, or the room was excessively reverberant [5]\n- **ween2011-04-14.mk4v.flac16**: source not stated; 33 songs; 164 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Bobby Ogdin performed on keyboard for this concert [3]\n- Attendee calls it their best Ween show and the best archival recording [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2011-04-14.km184**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: Neumann km 184 > Apogee Mini-Me > Oade WM Marantz 661 @ 24/48 [1]. Also: Notes list specific tracks, marking two songs with asterisks [1]\n- **ween2011-04-14.ccm41**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: Schoeps ccm41 (DINa) > Lunatec V2 > Sound Devices 702 @ 24/48 [2]. Also: Notes list specific tracks, marking two songs with asterisks [2]\n- **ween2011-04-14.mk4v.flac16**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk4v (DINa) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Mytek Stereo 192 ADC > Tascam HD-P2 (24/48) [3]",
